    {"type":"text","id":"draft_t","x":465,"y":225,"width":270,"height":140,"text":"DSpark 为 draft model\n手工构造 ForwardBatch(...)\n↓\n没有经过 init_new()\n↓\nnum_token_non_padded = None\n_cpu 字段同样未初始化","originalText":"DSpark 为 draft model\n手工构造 ForwardBatch(...)\n↓\n没有经过 init_new()\n↓\nnum_token_non_padded = None\n_cpu 字段同样未初始化","fontSize":17,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","lineHeight":1.3,"strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":427,"version":1,"versionNonce":428,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null},
