    {"type":"text","id":"difference_t","x":470,"y":480,"width":260,"height":120,"text":"为什么以前没暴露？\n\nEP = 1\n不启用这段非 Padding 统计\n字段未被读取，所以正常\n\nEP > 1 才进入相关路径","originalText":"为什么以前没暴露？\n\nEP = 1\n不启用这段非 Padding 统计\n字段未被读取，所以正常\n\nEP > 1 才进入相关路径","fontSize":15,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","lineHeight":1.3,"strokeColor":"#374151","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":431,"version":1,"versionNonce":432,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":null},
